  - title: LEVEL 15 | Wiring Guide
    explanation: SwitchOutput -> R1 input and R2 input; R1 output -> red LED anode;
      R2 output -> green LED anode; both LED cathodes -> Battery_negative.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | STEP-BY-STEP CONNECTIONS
    parts:
